<!--Post: 6823--><!--Time: 1108021681-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6823"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:hackenmaster@yahoo.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Wichitan<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Wichitan<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 09, 2005 - 11:48 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Do to the over whelming demand of the chatroom, I have been asked to start a thread on EXACTLY  when will BTK be caught, turn himself in, or never be heard from again.  And maybe TOM could put a twist on it and give the winner a free IP FREHLEY T-shirt? <BR> <BR>MARCH 13th, 2005 <BR> <BR>wichitan<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6823-->
<!--Post: 6907--><!--Time: 1108070671-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6907"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Ryddik<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Ryddik<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 10, 2005 - 1:24 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I think btk will either be caught, turn him self in, or die within the next 6-12 months. The time span between drops is becoming shorter with each new drop which I think indicates coming to a end one way or another.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6907-->
<!--Post: 6932--><!--Time: 1108082155-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6932"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Audreyamw<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Audreyamw<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 10, 2005 - 4:35 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I think the WPD will make an arrest within 2 years.  I keep waiting for the day I come to this Web site and read, &#34;Arrest in BTK case, suspect to be charged.&#34;  Come on, Wichita.  Someone knows this guy! <BR> <BR>If he isn&#39;t caught, I wonder if he would spend the next 10 years or more sending messages to WPD and the media?  That would be a first.  I can&#39;t think of another SK who has kept up communications with LE or media for that long.  Not even the infamous &#34;Zodiac.&#34;  BTK is definitely an original. <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6932-->
<!--Post: 6934--><!--Time: 1108083056-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6934"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:blingbling1169@yahoo.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Cawichitan<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Cawichitan<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 10, 2005 - 4:50 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Well guys, 58 is still young if he is staying fit plus evil hardly dies! I think that he is going to be apprehended doing something stupid or he is going to turn himself in. It will be another year or a little bit less. I think he is tired and is ready for this to be over sooner than later. I had a dream a week or so ago and he was appreheneded. He was fat in the belly and looked tired, I think this will be over soon, one way or another. So my guess is late 2005 early 2006-but no later than March 2006-the anniverary of his coming back.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6934-->
<!--Post: 6965--><!--Time: 1108097113-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6965"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Ivy_leaguer<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Ivy_leaguer<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 10, 2005 - 8:45 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->It seems unlikely the BTK Strangler will be apprehended. If, the unknown subject senses he may be captured he will most probably end the communications for the moment and retreat into obscurity. He may return later when interest in him subsides. He may have ceased his earlier communications in the late 1970s based on the fear of being captured. The unknown subject enjoys freedom too much to surrender to authorities.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6965-->
<!--Post: 6969--><!--Time: 1108098234-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6969"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Toto<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Toto<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 10, 2005 - 9:03 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->When someone recognizes his artwork or handwriting and turns him in.  <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6969-->
<!--Post: 6974--><!--Time: 1108100544-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6974"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->George<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->George<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 10, 2005 - 9:42 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I predict he&#39;ll never turn himself in and will probably never be identified, let alone captured. Hope I&#39;m wrong.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6974-->
<!--Post: 6994--><!--Time: 1108111205-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6994"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:hackenmaster@yahoo.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Wichitan<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Wichitan<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 11, 2005 - 12:40 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->This is a free raffle, and I&#39;m the only one with not only a month, but a date....come on people dig deeper! <BR> <BR>wichitan<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6994-->
<!--Post: 6995--><!--Time: 1108112868-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6995"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Jujuree<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Jujuree<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 11, 2005 - 1:07 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->April 29th, 2005.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6995-->
<!--Post: 6998--><!--Time: 1108115197-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6998"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Weeza<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Weeza<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 11, 2005 - 1:46 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->April 27th, 2005<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6998-->
<!--Post: 7013--><!--Time: 1108131855-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7013"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Essevi<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Essevi<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 11, 2005 - 6:24 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I agree with George.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7013-->
<!--Post: 7056--><!--Time: 1108157102-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7056"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:tbjostad@cox.net" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Toto<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Toto<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 11, 2005 - 1:25 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I agree he&#39;ll never turn himself in nor commit suicide.  He&#39;s way too self-absorbed and narccistic for either of those.   But I vehemently disagree he&#39;ll die unidentified.   He wants his legacy!!!  It&#39;s everything to him.    Besides, can you see him passing up the opportunity to thumb his nose at WPD one more time?   He would take great pride in dying without being caught.    He&#39;ll make sure he&#39;s identified in death.   Probably leave a &#39;Ha Ha Gotcha&#39;  sign around his neck addressed to all the chief&#39;s and DA&#39;s we&#39;ve had during his &#39;reign of terror&#39;.        <BR> <BR>OK Wichitan, I like a good crap shoot.  My money&#39;s on October 18, 2005.   <BR> <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7056-->
<!--Post: 7058--><!--Time: 1108158350-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7058"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Nm_pi<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Nm_pi<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 11, 2005 - 1:45 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Never. The last communication was it. He wanted to give a little teaser, and to make the point that he is out there and doing fine, thank you...<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7058-->
<!--Post: 7195--><!--Time: 1108270860-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7195"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Raidar<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Raidar<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 12, 2005 - 9:01 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->BTK will never turn hisself in.He feels no remorse for anything or he would have already confessed.I do think the only way he will be identified is if he is turned in by someone that knows him or when he dies.I really think the police dept. needs to release everything they have on him if they ever want a chance to catch him.I mean we cant go on &#40;he might have brown hair or black.. he might have glasses he might not.. he might be tall or regular hight.&#41;Come on WPD ya&#39;ll have to know something..I think the all of the letters should be released 100% all contents.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7195-->
